    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262">

                <pb facs="0374" n="368" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg368"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-04-13"><hi rendition="#italic">April 13,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that to the end of March the war claim of Great Britain is
                    £4,800,000; monthly expenses thereafter, £120,000. <pb facs="0375" n="369"
                        xml:id="pg369"/> Should occupation be continued until the end of the year,
                    £1,600,000 additional.</p>
                <p>Hopes to get vote next Tuesday on our lump-sum proposition)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
